  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Climate-Resilient Humanitarian WASH Coordination</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project supports the work of the Global Water, Sanitation and Hygiene (WASH) Cluster Climate Change Working Group through the further dissemination of and support to the Climate Action Framework for Humanitarian WASH, and the Climate Action Plans in Somalia and Ethiopia, through technical coordination, stakeholder engagement and advocacy.The project also supports collaboration on WASH, climate change and environmental sustainability issues, contributing to operational learning and knowledge exchange relevant to humanitarian WASH coordination and programming. Through these activities, the project will strengthen climate action in coordination, capacity development, evidence generation and the operationalisation of climate action approaches across humanitarian WASH preparedness, response and recovery efforts.</narrative>
  </description>
